<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila succini Turing wavenumber at 2.8 µm (44 Ma, detail scale s0) — Code-to-model traceability: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Each modelling step in run_model follows the docstring: Jacobian, onset, D_u solve, numeric dispersion, 2D field, chronoseries scaling. Lean checks the integer shadow of the onset inequality, the 377 nm compression, and the mode-count increase. It does not formalise the real eigenvalue." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila succini Turing wavenumber at 2.8 µm (44 Ma, detail scale s0) — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Schnakenberg kinetics, the Jacobian trace and determinant (stable without diffusion), sigma(k), and k_c = argmax sigma are implemented, and D_u is solved so the peak is within 0.01 percent of 2.759e-06 m. The textbook k_h is computed and is not silently substituted for k_c. Deducted because no Drosophila morphogen pair is identified in Hennig 1965, and because k_h (7.30) and k_c (6.28) differ above onset." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila succini Turing wavenumber at 2.8 µm (44 Ma, detail scale s0) — Morphometric validation: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "On the pre-registered band sigma > -0.25 (10 modes) the spectral PDE matches analytic sigma with Pearson r = 0.999999997 and RMSE = 2.98e-5. The full spectrum is reported at r = 0.793 and is not used as the gate. The nonlinear radial peak is 2.46 µm against the linear 2.76 µm (FFT binning on a 3.2-wavelength box). Specimen foreground fraction 0.404 versus a 0.62 prior, coherency 0.746 versus the field's 0.883, circularity 0.048 versus 0.80, and orientation KS 0.094 versus 0. None of those pairs are equal." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-berryi-transferred-detail-wavelength>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-equal-diffusivity-ablation-sigma-max>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-ks-distance-of-gradient-orientations-specimen-vs-simulation>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-nonlinear-spot-field-dominant-wavelength>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-contour-circularity>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-foreground-fraction>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-structure-tensor-coherency>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-stem-predecessor-sigma-max-at-r-8-40>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-succini-critical-wavelength-from-argmax-sigma-k>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-turing-band-pearson-r-of-pde-growth-vs-analytic-sigma>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-turing-band-rmse-of-sigma>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila succini Turing wavenumber at 2.8 µm (44 Ma, detail scale s0) — MorphoEval overall 86.5/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 keeps the Schnakenberg wavelength law at 2.759e-06 m and 44 Ma, and scores the D_u sweep, the stem and equal-diffusivity controls, the specimen segmentation, and the band-restricted dispersion fit. The remaining limits are the synthetic gallery card, the transferred berryi wavelength, the 11 percent nonlinear-wavelength binning offset, and the unsigned nanopubs. Overall 86.5/100 (faithfulness 85.4, reproducibility 89.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 88, Morphological realism / specimen match 80, Parameter expressivity 90, Morphometric validation 88, Source and data traceability 86, Code-to-model traceability 90, Reproducibility package 91. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_succini_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d, image/png, 448421 B, 1512×1008 px, artifact_sha256 8b3f9e4fcc75332bc97d3765fe96f67d99b1d3c05ae3318cd8eea040872fe584 (sha256 8b3f9e4fcc75332bc97d3765fe96f67d99b1d3c05ae3318cd8eea040872fe584), spec_fingerprint f5b636dc6a95053a09da7fe5fd86461e841d4ca25eb9122e457e095b842aad73. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: e5db01a3e13f63a6317e9540b0b493892dc3fdac609c17758cbc181cf60cf311; artifact_sha256: 8b3f9e4fcc75332bc97d3765fe96f67d99b1d3c05ae3318cd8eea040872fe584; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_succini_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_succini_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=e227ba771980817d..., datasets/drosophila_succini_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_succini_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=1a0de2972916cbfa...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952: reaction-diffusion selects a critical wavenumber. | Schnakenberg 1979: the activator-substrate rate laws used here. | Hennig 1965: Drosophila succini, Baltic amber, Stuttgarter Beiträge zur Naturkunde 145. | Grimaldi 1987: amber Drosophilidae, including the Dominican record used as the 19 Ma successor context.; reconstructed_in_script: sigma(k) from the Jacobian; k_c = argmax sigma; D_u chosen so lambda_c = 2.759e-06 m at r = 18.72. | D_u sweep from 0.25 to 3 times the succini value; lambda increases at every step. | Stem r = 8.40 and ablation r = 1 have negative sigma_max. | Berryi lambda by scaling both diffusivities with (98.43/114)^2. | Specimen mask: foreground fraction, circularity, coherency, and a Sobel-orientation KS distance.; transfer_boundary: The 2.382 µm berryi wavelength is a scale transfer, not a fossil measurement. | The gallery card is not the holotype. CV similarity is to that card. | Full-spectrum Pearson r of the PDE modes is about 0.79 because strongly damped modes mix the fast eigenvalue. The pre-registered band sigma > -0.25 has r > 0.98 and RMSE about 3e-5.; does_not_claim: A pixel identity between the spot field and an amber inclusion. | That k_h (determinant minimizer) equals k_c above onset. Here k_h is about 7.30 and k_c is about 6.28. | A signed nanopublication. No ~/.nanopub/profile.yml was present.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:hasScore 8.65e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila succini Turing wavenumber at 2.8 µm (44 Ma, detail scale s0) — Parameter expressivity: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "At fixed r = 18.72, lambda increases at each step of the D_u scale set {0.25, 0.50, 0.75, 1, 1.5, 2, 3}. The ratio axis is a separate control: r = 1 and r = 8.40 sit below onset and sigma_max is negative; r = 18.72 is unstable. Both are drawn on the comparison figure." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
